<title>UK: Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</title>
<headline>Lehman Brothers sets warrants on the S&amp;P 500 index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance SA has issued five million American-style put warrants, in three equal tranches, on the S&amp;P 500 index, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one index.</p>
<p> WARRANTS    STRIKE     ISS PRICE	PREMIUM	GEARING</p>
<p> PUT A	 775.0	5.97 DEM	 7.70 PCT     23.10 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT B	 800.0	7.58 DEM	 5.75 PCT     18.18 TIMES</p>
<p> PUT C	 825.0	9.49 DEM	 4.01 PCT     14.52 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   19.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	17.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT STG DDF	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
